			"wiki": "The training history is converted into a pandas DataFrame, augmented with trial metadata (trial number, model name), and appended to `oracle.csv`. The trained Keras model is also saved to a `.keras` file in the project's `models` directory.",
			"cellName": "Save Trial Results to Disk - simple_cerebros_random_search.py:L513-525",
