			"fileName": "cifar-10-efficientnetv2s.py",
			"wiki": "The `SimpleCerebrosRandomSearch` class is instantiated with all hyperparameters for the search. This includes the training data, labels, validation split, search space constraints (e.g., number of levels), and the custom `embedding_model` which will serve as a fixed base for all tested architectures.",
			"cellName": "Initialize Cerebros AutoML Search - cifar-10-efficientnetv2s.py:L135-179",
