			"fileName": "cifar-10-efficientnetv2s.py",
			"wiki": "Cerebros internally generates, compiles, and trains multiple dense classifier architectures. Each new architecture is attached to the output of the provided `embedding_model`. The performance of each candidate model is evaluated on a validation set, and the best score (`val_top_1_categorical_accuracy`) is tracked.",
			"cellName": "Run Neural Architecture Search - cifar-10-efficientnetv2s.py:L180-181",
