			"fileName": "generative-proof-of-concept-CPU-preprocessing-in-memory.py",
			"wiki": "The best model is wrapped inside a `CerebrosNotGPT` object. This class provides a high-level `generate` method that encapsulates the logic for autoregressive text generation, including sampling strategies.",
