			"fileName": "llm_utils.py",
			"wiki": "The `generate` method performs autoregressive text generation. In a loop, it feeds the current sequence of tokens to the model, gets the probability distribution for the next token, applies sampling logic (penalties, temperature, top-k/top-p), selects the next token, and appends it to the sequence.",
			"cellName": "Generate Text Autoregressively - llm_utils.py:L418-598",
			"cellId": "dd0bceac-be0a-4e65-8b44-ec306415e876",
