		"kubeflow-pipeline/amesnopreprcoessing0002a-vnrny.katib.yaml-simstep-2b30a4ea-592d-4715-958c-6682fe42aabe": {
			"path": "kubeflow-pipeline/amesnopreprcoessing0002a-vnrny.katib.yaml-simstep-2b30a4ea-592d-4715-958c-6682fe42aabe",
			"fileName": "amesnopreprcoessing0002a-vnrny.katib.yaml",
			"wiki": "The Kubernetes Job starts a container which executes the specified python command. This command, `create_and_wait_kfp_run`, initiates a Kubeflow Pipeline run, passing the trial's hyperparameters to the pipeline. The pipeline contains the actual logic for training the Cerebros model.",
			"cellName": "Flow 1: Trial Job Executes KFP Run - amesnopreprcoessing0002a-vnrny.katib.yaml:L119-130",
			"cellId": "28447c36-c706-419a-9c50-d8fc86c16a93",
