			"fileName": "generative-proof-of-concept-CPU-preprocessing-in-memory.py",
			"wiki": "The core training logic is executed. A `SimpleCerebrosRandomSearch` object is instantiated with the hyperparameters sampled by Optuna. The `run_random_search()` method is called, which builds, trains, and evaluates one or more model architectures for this trial.",
			"cellName": "Flow 2: Execute Training with Sampled Hyperparameters - generative-proof-of-concept-CPU-preprocessing-in-memory.py:L318-368",
			"cellId": "456bb626-1ed2-4f59-9709-dc69f1434b5c",
