			"fileName": "generative-proof-of-concept-CPU-preprocessing-in-memory.py",
			"wiki": "After all `N_TRIALS` are completed, the `study.optimize()` loop finishes. The script then accesses the `study.best_trial` attribute to retrieve and print the value and parameters of the most successful trial.",
			"cellName": "Flow 2: Conclude Study and Print Best Trial - generative-proof-of-concept-CPU-preprocessing-in-memory.py:L853-858",
