			"fileName": "simple_cerebros_random_search.py",
			"wiki": "The process begins by instantiating the `SimpleCerebrosRandomSearch` class. This is the main entry point for the AutoML process, where the user provides high-level configuration for the neural architecture search, including parameters that control network topology.",
