			"fileName": "dense_automl_structural_component.py",
			"wiki": "The `DenseAutoMlStructuralComponent` and `DenseLateralConnectivity` base classes receive the parameters and store them as instance variables. These classes encapsulate the logic related to vertical/skip connections and lateral connections, respectively.",
			"cellName": "Config: Store Structural and Lateral Parameters - dense_automl_structural_component.py:L135-213",
