			"fileName": "neural_network_future.py",
			"wiki": "The `NeuralNetworkFuture` object is initialized. It acts as a blueprint for a specific neural network architecture. It inherits from the same base classes and stores the configuration parameters. It then begins to create the `Level` objects that define the network's layers.",
			"cellName": "Config: Initialize Neural Network Blueprint - neural_network_future.py:L25-109",
			"cellId": "aeb53633-cc9b-48fc-9a93-c67e07e2f5b1",
