			"fileName": "dense_automl_structural_component.py",
			"wiki": "The `set_lateral_connectivity_future` method on the `DenseUnit` calls `select_connection_or_not` (from `DenseLateralConnectivity`). This method uses `p_lateral_connection` to stochastically decide if a connection should be made and `max_consecutive_lateral_connections` to limit the length of lateral connection chains.",
			"cellName": "Logic: Calculate Lateral Connections - dense_automl_structural_component.py:L224-247",
			"cellId": "78448410-428c-485d-a6eb-fa5fc8d991ef",
