			"fileName": "generative-proof-of-concept-CPU-preprocessing-in-memory.py",
			"wiki": "The script uses `subprocess.run` to execute the `mlflow server` command. This starts a local MLflow tracking server that listens for API requests on the specified port, enabling the script to log data.",
