			"fileName": "generative-proof-of-concept-CPU-preprocessing-in-memory.py",
			"wiki": "The script calls `mlflow.set_experiment()` to create a new experiment or set an existing one as active. All subsequent runs and their data will be logged under this experiment in the MLflow UI.",
