			"fileName": "generative-proof-of-concept-CPU-preprocessing-in-memory.py",
			"wiki": "Upon completion of Phase I-b, the script finds the minimum perplexity achieved during this phase from the training history and logs it to MLflow using `mlflow.log_metric()`. This value is the final objective score for the Optuna trial.",
			"cellName": "Log Phase I-b Perplexity Metric - generative-proof-of-concept-CPU-preprocessing-in-memory.py:L799",
			"cellId": "fb7637d8-fc25-4c71-8be2-5ac5f302729f",
