			"fileName": "regression-example-ames-no-preproc-val-set.py",
			"wiki": "Inside `hash_based_split`, since `hash_column` is specified as '*', the function applies the `hash_a_row` function to each row of the input DataFrame to generate a unique hash value for every sample.",
