			"fileName": "regression-example-ames-no-preproc-val-set.py",
			"wiki": "After collecting hash values for all rows, `hash_based_split` uses a modulus operation on the hashes to create a boolean mask (`train_idx`). This mask deterministically assigns each row to either the training or testing set, preventing data leakage for identical rows.",
			"cellName": "Perform Deterministic Split - regression-example-ames-no-preproc-val-set.py:L83-101",
