			"fileName": "regression-example-ames-no-preproc-val-set.py",
			"wiki": "The main script initializes the `SimpleCerebrosRandomSearch` class. Crucially, it passes the pre-split training data, sets `validation_split=0.0` to disable automatic splitting, and provides the pre-split validation data directly via the `validation_data` parameter.",
			"cellName": "Initialize SimpleCerebrosRandomSearch - regression-example-ames-no-preproc-val-set.py:L169-214",
