			"fileName": "simple_cerebros_random_search.py",
			"wiki": "The `__init__` method of `SimpleCerebrosRandomSearch` receives the parameters and assigns them to instance attributes. `self.validation_split` is set to 0.0, and `self.validation_data` now holds the custom validation set tuple.",
			"cellName": "Store Pre-Split Validation Data - simple_cerebros_random_search.py:L368-369",
