			],
			"description": "<ul><li>Solves complex text classification problems like spam or phishing detection by building on top of pre-trained language models</li><li>Integrates with models from TensorFlow Hub (e</li><li>g</li><li>, BERT) or other libraries (e</li><li>g</li><li>, GPT-2) to generate powerful text embeddings</li><li>Cerebros then performs a neural architecture search for the classification head, which is attached to the embedding model</li><li>Users pass a pre-trained Keras model directly into <code>SimpleCerebrosRandomSearch</code> via the <code>base_models</code> parameter, as shown in <code>text-class-ham-or-spam</li><li>py</code> and <code>phishing_email_detection_gpt2</li><li>py</code></li></ul>",
