					"simStepDescription": "A complete Keras model is constructed. It starts with an Input layer matching the original CIFAR-10 image size (32x32x3), adds a Resizing layer to scale images up to what EfficientNet expects (384x384x3), and then passes the resized image to the feature extraction model. This pipeline becomes the `embedding_model`.",
