			"description": "<ul><li>Solves image classification tasks by leveraging state-of-the-art pre-trained vision models for feature extraction</li><li>The user provides a pre-trained model like EfficientNet or MobileNet as a base model to generate embeddings from input images</li><li>Cerebros searches for an optimal dense classifier architecture to connect to the features extracted by the base model</li><li>This transfer learning approach is demonstrated in <code>cifar10-example</li><li>py</code> and <code>cifar-10-efficientnetv2s</li><li>py</code></li></ul>",
