					"simStepLabel": "Execute Neural Architecture Search & Training",
					"simStepDescription": "The `run_random_search` method is called. This component automatically builds, trains, and evaluates multiple neural network architectures based on the provided configuration. It searches for the architecture that minimizes the perplexity metric.",
					"isEdge": 0,
					"sourceCodeMapping": {
