					"simStepLabel": "Flow 1: Katib Controller Updates Experiment Status",
					"simStepDescription": "The Katib controller's metrics collector parses the log from the completed trial, extracts the metric value, and updates the `Experiment` status. The Bayesian optimization algorithm uses this new data point to inform the next set of hyperparameters. It also updates the `currentOptimalTrial` if the current trial is the best one so far.",
					"isEdge": 0,
					"sourceCodeMapping": {
