			"description": "<ul><li>Integrates with hyperparameter optimization frameworks like Kubeflow Katib and Optuna to automate the search for optimal training and architectural parameters</li><li>Users can define a search space for parameters like learning rate, batch size, and network dimensions in a declarative format (e</li><li>g</li><li>, <code>kubeflow-pipeline/amesnopreprcoessing0002a-vnrny</li><li>katib</li><li>yaml</code>)</li><li>The framework orchestrates multiple parallel trials, each running a Cerebros search, to efficiently find the best hyperparameter combination</li><li>Integration with MLflow for experiment tracking is also demonstrated, allowing for detailed logging of parameters and metrics</li></ul>",
