					"simStepDescription": "The `parse_predecessor_connections_to_level` method uses the `predecessor_level_connection_affinity_factor_main` parameter to calculate the number of connections to make to units in a predecessor level. The `maximum_skip_connection_depth` parameter implicitly constrains which predecessor levels are considered.",
