			"description": "<ul><li>Provides advanced users with granular control over the neural architecture search process itself</li><li>Allows direct tuning of core Cerebros parameters that define the network topology, such as vertical skip-connection depth (<code>maximum_skip_connection_depth</code>) and connection density (<code>predecessor_level_connection_affinity_factor_main</code>)</li><li>Enables control over lateral connections within network levels, including the probability (<code>p_lateral_connection</code>) and maximum chain length (<code>max_consecutive_lateral_connections</code>)</li><li>This allows for exploring novel classes of network structures, which is the core innovation detailed in <code>documentation/cerebros-technical-details</li><li>md</code></li></ul>",
