				}
			],
			"description": "<ul><li>Integrates with MLflow to log hyperparameters, metrics (like perplexity), and results from each AutoML trial</li><li>Allows for easy comparison of different architectures and training runs through the MLflow UI</li><li>Provides a structured way to manage the complexity of running numerous experiments, especially when combined with hyperparameter optimization tools like Optuna</li><li>The setup and usage are detailed in <code>MLFLOW</li><li>md</code> and implemented in <code>generative-proof-of-concept-CPU-preprocessing-in-memory</li><li>py</code></li></ul>",
